<section image-layout="blank" id="lPyRbT0GMq" vertical-align="center"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item><p role="eyebrow">Teaching analogy—not a quotation, proof, or empirical study</p><h2>Equal permission can still produce unequal participation</h2><freeform-block w="840" h="250"><box type="content" x="0" y="8" w="145" h="55" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center"><h4>Promise</h4><p font-size="16pt">The same right to speak</p></box><box type="content" x="170" y="12" w="80" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="surface" style="padding:4pt; border-radius:4pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt"><b>A</b></p></box><box type="content" x="270" y="12" w="80" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="surface" style="padding:4pt; border-radius:4pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt"><b>B</b></p></box><box type="content" x="370" y="12" w="80" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="surface" style="padding:4pt; border-radius:4pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt"><b>C</b></p></box><box type="content" x="470" y="12" w="80" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="surface" style="padding:4pt; border-radius:4pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt"><b>D</b></p></box><box type="content" x="570" y="12" w="80" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="surface" style="padding:4pt; border-radius:4pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt"><b>E</b></p></box><box type="content" x="670" y="12" w="80" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="surface" style="padding:4pt; border-radius:4pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt"><b>F</b></p></box><shape preset="line" x="150" y="66" w="620" h="2" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape><box type="content" x="0" y="87" w="145" h="60" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center"><h4>Practice</h4><p font-size="16pt">One voice occupies the floor</p></box><box type="content" x="170" y="94" w="350" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="accent" style="padding:4pt; border-radius:4pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt"><b>A · most airtime</b></p></box><box type="content" x="530" y="94" w="42" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="surface" style="padding:2pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt">B</p></box><box type="content" x="576" y="94" w="42" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="surface" style="padding:2pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt">C</p></box><box type="content" x="622" y="94" w="42" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="surface" style="padding:2pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt">D</p></box><box type="content" x="668" y="94" w="42" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="surface" style="padding:2pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt">E</p></box><box type="content" x="714" y="94" w="42" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="surface" style="padding:2pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt">F</p></box><shape preset="line" x="150" y="151" w="620" h="2" stroke="palette-3" stroke-width="3"></shape><box type="content" x="0" y="170" w="145" h="62" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center"><h4>Revision</h4><p font-size="16pt">Turn structure supports each voice</p></box><box type="content" x="170" y="179" w="80" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-2" style="padding:4pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt"><b>A</b></p></box><box type="content" x="270" y="179" w="80" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-2" style="padding:4pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt"><b>B</b></p></box><box type="content" x="370" y="179" w="80" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-2" style="padding:4pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt"><b>C</b></p></box><box type="content" x="470" y="179" w="80" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-2" style="padding:4pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt"><b>D</b></p></box><box type="content" x="570" y="179" w="80" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-2" style="padding:4pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt"><b>E</b></p></box><box type="content" x="670" y="179" w="80" h="46" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-2" style="padding:4pt;"><p align="center" font-size="18pt"><b>F</b></p></box></freeform-block><p role="caption">Illustrative pattern, not measured seminar data. It exposes a tension in the practice’s promise of equal participation.</p></grid-item></grid></section>